{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-08-12 16:25:00', 'title': "INDIANA AMERICAN WATER ACQUIRES RIVER'S EDGE WATER AND WASTEWATER SYSTEMS IN SOUTHEAST INDIANA", 'text': "JEFFERSONVILLE, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INDIANA AMERICAN WATER PRESIDENT MATT PRINE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S ACQUISITION OF THE RIVER'S EDGE WATER AND WASTEWATER SYSTEMS IN INDIANA."}